你给她买了戒指啊
You bought her a ring?

195
00:08:50,260 --> 00:08:52,660
不  这是我祖上一代代传下来的
No, no, no. This has been in my family for generations.

196
00:08:52,660 --> 00:08:55,780
除了中间有一小段时间  印第安人
Except for a short time when Comanches cut off

197
00:08:55,780 --> 00:08:58,650
把我曾曾曾祖母的手指切下来  把戒指偷走
my great-great-great-grandmother's finger and stole it.

198
00:08:59,230 --> 00:09:00,880
-谢尔顿  这太惨了  -不
- Sheldon, that's awful. - No.

199
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:03,310
德州游骑兵追到他们的村子里
The Texas Rangers tracked them down to their village

200
00:09:03,310 --> 00:09:05,640
把整个村子给屠了  一个活口都没留
and slaughtered every last one of them, so...

201
00:09:06,130 --> 00:09:07,960
所以这是个皆大欢喜的结局
it was a happy ending.

202
00:09:08,550 --> 00:09:10,970
至少我的九指祖母欢喜了
Well, for my nine-fingered Nana.

203
00:09:11,820 --> 00:09:14,570
说回戒指  艾米知道这事吗
Okay, back to the ring. Does Amy even know about this?

204
00:09:14,570 --> 00:09:16,010
不  我还没来得及提
