她就跟我分手了
before I could broach the subject.

206
00:09:17,760 --> 00:09:20,020
真遗憾  你一定觉得天都塌了吧
Oh, man, I'm sorry-- that must have been devastating for you.

207
00:09:20,020 --> 00:09:21,400
完全没有  我没事
No, not at all. No, I'm fine.

208
00:09:21,400 --> 00:09:23,970
艾米对我们的感情持保留态度
You know, Amy had reservations about our relationship,

209
00:09:23,970 --> 00:09:25,520
所以这就是最好的结果
so all worked out for the best.

210
00:09:25,520 --> 00:09:27,560
-我知道  可...  -都说了我没事
- I know. It just... - I said I'm fine!

211
00:09:33,500 --> 00:09:35,650
我们有点跑题了
We've gotten a little off-topic.

212
00:09:36,580 --> 00:09:38,740
就让我来说个笑话
Allow me to make things entertaining again

213
00:09:38,740 --> 00:09:41,590
给这部"史"记增加点娱乐性
in this little Spockumentary.

214
00:09:45,680 --> 00:09:47,540
那是莱纳德想的笑话
That was Leonard's joke.

215
00:09:54,910 --> 00:09:57,720
小时候当我面临两难处境时
As a child, when faced with a dilemma,

216
00:09:57,720 --> 00:10:01,320
我母亲会鼓励我问  "耶稣会怎么做"
