217
00:10:01,320 --> 00:10:04,540
答案永远都是  "爱邻如爱己"
The answer to that was always, "Love thy neighbor."

218
00:10:04,540 --> 00:10:08,540
但我的邻居有一颗烂牙  所以...
But my neighbor had a dead tooth, so...

219
00:10:08,930 --> 00:10:11,060
我不可能爱他
that wasn't going to happen.

220
00:10:12,390 --> 00:10:13,200
但...
But...

221
00:10:13,200 --> 00:10:17,090
也因此我把问题改成  "史波克会怎么做"
that's why I changed it to, "What would Spock do?"

222
00:10:17,090 --> 00:10:18,830
你觉得对你有帮助吗
Did you find that helpful?

223
00:10:18,830 --> 00:10:21,590
对啊  比如三年前
Yes. Oh, for example, three years ago

224
00:10:21,590 --> 00:10:24,380
当我发现佩妮总吃掉我所有果塔饼干
when I discovered Penny was eating all my Pop-Tarts,

225
00:10:24,380 --> 00:10:27,200
我没有生气或怀恨在心
instead of getting angry or vindictive,

226
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:29,470
反之我装了一个地板保险箱
you know, I got a floor safe.

227
00:10:30,130 --> 00:10:32,350
我就知道我有闻到饼干味
I knew I could smell 'em.

228
00:10:33,190 --> 00:10:35,000
不如从你小时候说起
What about from when you were a kid?

229
00:10:35,000 --> 00:10:37,650
好的  在我八岁的时候
Oh, certainly. Uh, when I was eight years old,

230
00:10:37,650 --> 00:10:40,120
比利·斯帕克斯在操场上把我逼到角落
Billy Sparks cornered me in the playground.

231
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:42,340
我就问我自己  "史波克会怎么做"
I asked myself, "What would Spock do?"

232
00:10:42,340 --> 00:10:44,760
然后我抓住比利的肩膀
Then I grabbed Billy on his shoulder

233
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:48,090
使出了我人生第一次瓦肯掐脖术
and performed my first Vulcan nerve pinch.

234
00:10:44,760 --> 00:10:48,090
掐脖术是瓦肯人的一种身体对抗技巧
由伦纳德·尼莫伊本人亲自发明

235
00:10:49,670 --> 00:10:50,650
管用吗
Did it work?

236
00:10:50,650 --> 00:10:52,910
没用啊  他把我锁骨弄断了
Oh, no-- he broke my collarbone.

237
00:10:54,500 --> 00:10:56,500
现在一动还会咯咯响
I can still hear it click.

238
00:10:57,700 --> 00:10:59,780
那一定让你非常失望
That must have been very upsetting for you.

239
00:10:59,780 --> 00:11:00,880
完全没有
Oh, not at all.

240
00:11:00,880 --> 00:11:03,380
我前面就说了  效仿史波克的重点
As I said, the entire point of emulating Spock

241
00:11:03,380 --> 00:11:05,620
就是克服人类情绪
was to rise above human emotion,

242
00:11:05,620 --> 00:11:07,920
而我已花一生的时间来掌握它
which I've spent a lifetime mastering.

243
00:11:11,230 --> 00:11:12,470
怎么回事
Excuse me?

244
00:11:12,470 --> 00:11:13,840
抱歉  当我不在
I'm sorry. I'm not here.

245
00:11:14,220 --> 00:11:16,830
不  你这样是啥意思
No. You went . What does mean?

246
00:11:18,290 --> 00:11:20,120
你的确那样了
You did go.

247
00:11:20,610 --> 00:11:23,550
好吧  谢尔顿  我虽然不是专家
All right, fine. Well, Sheldon, I'm no expert,

248
00:11:23,550 --> 00:11:25,470
但你好像完全没抓住史波克的重点
but aren't you completely missing the point of Spock?

249
00:11:25,470 --> 00:11:27,090
他喜欢表现得好像自己没有情感
I mean, he liked to act like he had no emotions,

250
00:11:27,090 --> 00:11:28,710
但他仍是半个人类
but he was still half human.

251
00:11:28,710 --> 00:11:30,420
就像你
Just like you.

252
00:11:31,470 --> 00:11:32,790
我的意思是  你假装你没有
I'm just saying, you pretend you don't,

253
00:11:32,790 --> 00:11:34,840
但你也是有情绪的人  就像其他人一样
but you have feelings just like everybody else.

254
00:11:34,840 --> 00:11:37,020
不对  你看我
Not true. No, look at me.

255
00:11:37,020 --> 00:11:39,250
我本来要向一位女孩求婚
I had an engagement ring to give a girl,

256
00:11:39,250 --> 00:11:40,960
但在求婚之前  她就先跟我分手了
and instead, she rejected me.

257
00:11:40,960 --> 00:11:43,340
我有对此情绪激动吗  没有
And am I emotional about that? No.

258
00:11:43,340 --> 00:11:45,080
相反我坐在沙发上
No, I am sitting here on a couch,

259
00:11:45,080 --> 00:11:47,590
若无其事般地谈论我最爱的电视角色
talking about my favorite TV character like nothing happened.

260
00:11:47,590 --> 00:11:49,050
因为我跟他一模一样
'Cause I am just like him:

261
00:11:49,050 --> 00:11:50,640
由始至终保持理智
all logical, all the time.

262
00:11:50,640 --> 00:11:51,620
亲爱的  你已经开始嚷嚷了
Sweetie, you're yelling.

263
00:11:51,620 --> 00:11:53,360
因为当我用正常音量讲话时
Because when I speak at a regular volume,

264
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,320
都没人相信
no one seems to believe me

265
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:56,760
我已经把艾米的这破事抛诸脑后了
that I've put this Amy nonsense behind me!

266
00:12:02,570 --> 00:12:05,790
这部纪录片的精彩度绝对爆表
This documentary is gonna be awesome.

267
00:12:08,780 --> 00:12:11,210
-你在下面没事吧  -没事
- You gonna be okay down here? - Yeah. Yeah,

268
00:12:11,210 --> 00:12:12,720
我觉得自己好像考古学家
I feel like an archaeologist.

269
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:15,760
印第安纳·琼斯之单户家庭房历险
Indiana Jones and the Single-Family Dwelling.

270
00:12:17,050 --> 00:12:19,210
看
Hey. Look!

271
