知道  我想那里应该是小室吧
Yeah. I think that's the den.

277
00:12:35,690 --> 00:12:38,210
好  我们应该是在餐厅下面了
Okay, so we must be under the dining room.

278
00:12:38,250 --> 00:12:39,440
没错
Yep.

279
00:12:39,440 --> 00:12:41,970
我知道你不想听到这个
You know, I know you don't want to hear this,

280
00:12:41,970 --> 00:12:44,620
但如果把那个小室改造成婴儿室
but it wouldn't take that much work to turn that den

281
00:12:44,620 --> 00:12:46,530
花不了什么功夫
into a nursery.

282
00:12:46,940 --> 00:12:48,570
我为什么不想听到这个呀
Why wouldn't I want to hear it?

283
00:12:48,570 --> 00:12:51,160
因为妮妮说你不想要孩子
'Cause Bernie said you didn't want kids.

284
00:12:51,160 --> 00:12:52,980
完全不是
That's not true at all.

285
00:12:52,980 --> 00:12:56,280
我非常希望她怀孕  相信我
I-I wish she'd get pregnant, believe me.

286
00:12:56,280 --> 00:13:00,230
我一有机会就往她身上爬
I'm climbing on top of her every chance I get.

287
00:13:01,760 --> 00:13:05,020
当然是以一种充满爱与恭敬的方式
In a... loving and respectful manner.

288
00:13:06,610 --> 00:13:07,720
重点是
The point is,

289
00:13:07,720 --> 00:13:11,640
我真的很想要孩子
I really do want kids.

290
00:13:13,410 --> 00:13:15,450
我不知道她为什么要骗你
I don't know why she's lying to you.

291
00:13:15,450 --> 00:13:17,160
她才是不想要孩子的那个
She's the one who doesn't want kids.

292
00:13:17,160 --> 00:13:19,080
事实上  每次我提到这事
In fact, every time I bring up the subject...

293
00:13:19,380 --> 00:13:21,310
地震来了
Earthquake!

294
00:13:22,810 --> 00:13:24,580
我的天  我们死定了
Oh, my God, we're gonna die!

295
00:13:28,030 --> 00:13:30,620
余震来了
Aftershock...!

296
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:34,760
我不敢相信谢尔顿本来打算向艾米求婚
I can't believe Sheldon was gonna ask Amy to marry him.

297
00:13:34,760 --> 00:13:35,650
我知道
I know.

298
00:13:35,650 --> 00:13:37,830
我更不敢相信他目睹了我们在沙发上"做"的事
I also can't believe he watched what we did on that couch

299
00:13:37,830 --> 00:13:39,840
-还敢坐在上面  -是呀
- and still sits on it. - Yeah.

300
00:13:42,730 --> 00:13:43,700
你们好
Hello.

301
00:13:43,700 --> 00:13:44,990
老兄  你还好吗
Hey, buddy. How you doing?

302
00:13:44,990 --> 00:13:46,060
好多了
Better.

303
00:13:46,060 --> 00:13:48,310
-威尔和亚当走了吗  -走了
- Did Wil and Adam leave? - Yeah.

304
00:13:48,910 --> 00:13:51,650
你觉得他们会在片里留下我暴怒的片段吗
Do you think they're going to put my outburst in the documentary?

305
00:13:51,650 --> 00:13:53,230
-肯定了  -绝对的
- Definitely. - Oh, yeah.

306
00:13:55,020 --> 00:13:57,470
我也不需要纠结这事
Well, there's no point in dwelling on it.

307
00:13:57,470 --> 00:13:58,900
借用一句瓦肯人的俗语
As the Vulcans say,

308
00:13:58,900 --> 00:14:02,120
"人已杀  你无力还命"[瓦肯语]
"Kup-fun-tor ha'kiv na'ish du stau."

309
00:14:03,350 --> 00:14:05,830
-你懂他的意思吗  -不懂
- Do you know what that means? - No.

310
00:14:05,830 --> 00:14:07,630
你说的是实话吗
Are you telling the truth?

311
00:14:07,630 --> 00:14:09,270
非也[瓦肯语]
Nirsh.

312
00:14:10,470 --> 00:14:12,020
这一切都太荒唐了
Well, this is ridiculous.

313
00:14:12,020 --> 00:14:15,230
总是为艾米的事伤心不能解决任何问题
Being upset about Amy all the time isn't accomplishing anything.

314
00:14:15,230 --> 00:14:16,800
如果我想解决这件事
If I want to resolve this situation,

315
00:14:16,800 --> 00:14:18,240
我就要行动起来
then I need to take action.

316
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:19,210
你要干什么
What are you gonna do?

317
00:14:19,210 --> 00:14:21,640
我要去找她  向她求婚
I'm going to find her and ask her to marry me.

318
00:14:21,990 --> 00:14:23,760
如果她答应了  我们就把这事彻底忘掉
And if she says yes, we can put this behind us

319
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:25,440
重新开始我们的关系
and resume our relationship.

320
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:27,210
如果她不肯答应
And if she says no...

321
00:14:27,750 --> 00:14:30,200
那她就可以去自尽了[瓦肯语]
well, then she can just ponfo miran.

322
00:14:33,730 --> 00:14:35,650
他不是真心的
He didn't meant that.

323
00:14:39,580 --> 00:14:44,240
也许我该解释下我为什么撒了个小谎
So I should probably explain why I kind of fibbed.

324
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:48,980
那想必是极好的
That would be nice.

325
00:14:50,410 --> 00:14:52,790
我告诉我爸你不想要孩子
I told my dad that you were the one who didn't want kids

326
00:14:52,790 --> 00:14:54,560
是因为我不想让他失望
because I didn't want to disappoint him.

327
00:14:54,560 --> 00:14:57,650
让我当替死鬼  你就忍心吗
But you were okay throwing me under the bus?

328
00:14:57,650 --> 00:15:00,260
事实证明  我对此毫不犹豫
Turns out yeah, I didn't think twice about it.

329
00:15:01,870 --> 00:15:04,730
妮妮  你不用担心我
Bernie, you don't need to worry about me.

330
00:15:04,730 --> 00:15:07,070
但是我不想看你错过这一切
But I don't want to see you miss out.

331
00:15:07,070 --> 00:15:11,360
养育孩子是我人生中最获益匪浅的体验
Raising children was the most rewarding experience of my life.

332
00:15:11,360 --> 00:15:13,470
得了吧  啥都是我妈干的
Oh, please. Mom did everything.

333
00:15:13,470 --> 00:15:15,120
你只不过是每天下班回家
All you did was come home from work,

334
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:16,620
坐在沙发上喝啤酒
sit on the couch and drink beer.

335
00:15:16,620 --> 00:15:19,390
这算哪门子养育孩子
How is that raising kids?

336
00:15:19,810 --> 00:15:22,800
这话题看来只适合夫妻俩谈
This is really a conversation for husband and wife.

337
00:15:23,640 --> 00:15:25,710
我这个外人还是洗洗回家吧
I'm gonna go clean up, hit the road.

338
00:15:25,710 --> 00:15:28,930
如果你妈问起  我晚上10点才离开这里
If your mother asks, I was here till 10:00.

339
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:34,020
真有趣  你爸爸不太做家务
It's interesting your father didn't help around the house

340
00:15:34,020 --> 00:15:35,830
霍华德也不爱做家务
and Howard doesn't help, either,

341
00:15:35,830 --> 00:15:37,300
所以从某种程度来说
so... in a way,

342
00:15:37,300 --> 00:15:39,960
霍华德不光是像你爸爸
Howard's not only like your father,

343
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:43,990
他还像是你不敢生的孩子一样
but he's also like the child that you're afraid to have.

344
00:15:45,520 --> 00:15:47,750
你怎么还不滚啊
Why are you still here?

345
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:51,470
好吧  我走了
Fine, I'll leave.

346
00:15:51,470 --> 00:15:55,320
不过某人好像需要换尿布啦
But it sounds like somebody needs a fresh diaper.

347
00:16:00,380 --> 00:16:01,290
好吧
All right...

348
00:16:01,650 --> 00:16:03,000
我承认
I admit...

349
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,940
我的确不怎么帮忙干家务
that I don't help out a lot.

350
00:16:05,700 --> 00:16:07,420
我需要改进这一点
And I need to work on that.

351
00:16:07,420 --> 00:16:08,440
但是
But...

352
00:16:08,440 --> 00:16:09,400
如果我们有了孩子
if we had a kid,

353
00:16:09,400 --> 00:16:11,000
一切都会不一样
it would be different.

354
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:13,450
-为什么  -因为
- Why? - Because...

355
00:16:13,450 --> 00:16:14,870
当我爸离开时
when my dad left,

356
00:16:14,870 --> 00:16:16,880
我对自己保证说
I promised myself that...

357
00:16:17,430 --> 00:16:21,530
如果我有机会做爸爸
if I ever had a chance to be a father...

358
00:16:22,100 --> 00:16:24,190
我一定陪在孩子身边
I'd always be there.

359
00:16:26,060 --> 00:16:27,920
好吧  我会考虑的
Okay, I'll think about it.

360
00:16:27,920 --> 00:16:29,750
你这是认真考虑
And this an actual "I'll think about it,"

361
00:16:29,750 --> 00:16:32,720
而不是像"我们能买辆带跨斗的摩托车吗"
not like the "Can we get a motorcycle with a sidecar

362
00:16:32,720 --> 00:16:34,420
那样的"考虑一下"吧
I'll think about it"?

363
00:16:36,170 --> 00:16:37,860
我是真的会认真考虑的
It's an actual "I'll think about it."

364
00:16:37,860 --> 00:16:42,240
我相信我会成为一位好爸爸
I really believe I'd be a great dad.

365
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,480
我也相信你会
I know you would.

366
00:16:45,420 --> 00:16:46,580
既然说到
Speaking of...

367
00:16:46,580 --> 00:16:48,760
生宝宝  不如我马上洗漱一下
making babies, what do you say I wash up

368
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:51,590
然后戳戳你的小通道好不好啊
and poke around your crawlspace?

369
00:17:24,510 --> 00:17:26,480
达娜医生觉得他没有那么危险
Dr. Dana feels he isn't that dangerous.

370
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:28,790
我凭什么相信你而不相信一位医生的话
What makes you right and a trained psychiatrist wrong?

371
00:17:28,790 --> 00:17:31,270
因为她有情感  而我没有
Because she feels. I don't.

372
00:17:31,270 --> 00:17:32,540
我只按逻辑做事
All I know is logic.

373
00:17:32,540 --> 00:17:33,900
切  鬼才相信
Yeah, right.

374
00:17:35,410 --> 00:17:37,430
你能就这样把情感大门关上
You can just shut your feelings off.

375
00:17:37,430 --> 00:17:39,990
电视又一次欺骗了我们
There goes television, lying to us again.

376
00:17:39,990 --> 00:17:41,540
我们让你养育我们的孩子
We let you raise our children,

377
00:17:41,540 --> 00:17:43,230
结果你就这样报答我们
and this is the thanks we get.

378
00:17:44,560 --> 00:17:46,810
莱纳德  我怎么能这么蠢
Leonard, how could I have been so foolish

379
00:17:46,810 --> 00:17:48,200
试图去追随一个虚构的
to try and follow in the footsteps

380
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:51,240
没有情感的外星人种族的脚步
of a made-up alien race with no emotions?

381
00:17:51,650 --> 00:17:55,700
除了崇拜科幻人物  你还可以
Well...now instead of idolizing fictional characters,

382
00:17:55,700 --> 00:17:59,720
把注意力放在身边的真实人物上啊
you can focus on the real people who are already in your life.

383
00:18:00,890 --> 00:18:03,130
好一句至理名言
Those are very wise words.

384
00:18:03,130 --> 00:18:04,420
谢谢
Thank you.

385
00:18:04,420 --> 00:18:05,750
如果来自电视里
They'd just be so much more comforting

386
00:18:05,750 --> 00:18:08,100
听起来就更安慰人了
if they came out of a television.

